  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **3 and 9**\n\n→ 45 ÷ 9 + 12 × 3 – 15 + 2 × 5 = 36\n\n→ 5 + 12 × 3 – 15 + 2 × 5 = 36\n\n→ 5 + 36 – 15 + 10 = 36\n\n→ 51 – 15 = 36\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.**\n\n2) **5 and 3**\n\n→ **45 ÷ 5** + 12 × 9 – 15 + 2 × 3 = 36\n\n→ 9 + **12 × 9** – 15 + **2 × 3** = 36\n\n→ **9 + 108** – 15 **+ 6** = 36\n\n→ 123 – 15 ≠ 36\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **12 and 5**\n\n→ **45 ÷ 3** + 5 × 9 – 15 + 2 × 12 = 36\n\n→ 15 + **5**** × 9** – 15 + **2 × 12** = 36\n\n→ **15 + 45** – 15 **+ 24 **= 36\n\n→ 84 – 15 = 36\n\n→ 69 ≠ 36\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **2 and 9**\n\n→ **45 ÷ 3** + 12 × 2 – 15 + 9 × 5 = 36\n\n→ 15 + **12 × 2** – 15 + **9**** × 5** = 36\n\n→ **15 + 24** – 15 **+ 45** = 36\n\n→ 84 – 15 = 36\n\n→ 69 ≠ 36\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****3 and 9\"**.",
